# Never commit pipeline outputs or secrets.
# NOTE: git ignore-rules do NOT support trailing inline comments - a '#' only
# starts a comment at the start of a line. Keep every pattern on its own line.

# ⚠ This directory held a Scaleway Terraform module until 2026-09-17 (never applied; the bucket moved to
# deploy/cloudflare-models). Its ignores stay, so a local terraform.tfvars or state left behind by that
# module — which carried provider keys — can never be committed from here.
terraform.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*

# --- pipeline outputs (inference-service.md IN-D10) ---
# ⚠⚠ A checkpoint tower is ~380 MB. Model artifacts are built out-of-band and published to the R2
# bucket; they never belong in the tree. The MANIFEST (models.json) is tracked — it is the thing a
# human writes — and everything the signer derives from it is not.
build/
*.onnx
*.bin
catalog.json
catalog.json.sig
